            "heading": "Shipping & Returns",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Free standard shipping on orders over US$100.</p><p>Standard orders are usually processed within 1–3 business days. Custom and embroidered orders require an additional 5–10 business days before shipping.</p><p><strong>Estimated transit time</strong><br/>United States: 7–12 business days<br/>Australia: 8–12 business days<br/>Europe: 6–10 business days<br/>Asia: 3–5 business days</p><p>Applicable VAT, GST or sales tax is shown at checkout where required. Vivnook covers applicable customs duties and import charges, so there are no surprise customs fees on delivery.</p><p>See our Shipping & Returns Policy for full details.</p>",
